		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00001 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e00001-s " data-id="e00001" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00001">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00002 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e00002-s " data-id="e00002" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00002">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00003 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e00003-s " data-id="e00003" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00003">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00004 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e00004-s " data-id="e00004" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00004">
    			<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e00005-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00005">Twelve Harvests</p>
					<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e00006-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00006">One single-origin a month · farmgate price on every bag</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00007 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e00007-s " data-id="e00007" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00007">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00008 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e00008-s " data-id="e00008" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00008">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00009 e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-1ol2zp5-e00009-s " data-id="e00009" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e00009">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000a e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e0000a-s " data-id="e0000a" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000a">
    			<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0000b-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000b">Harvest calendar, not a release calendar</p>
					<h1 data-interaction-id="e0000c" class="e-1ol2zp5-e0000c-s e-heading-base">Coffee arrives when it is ripe, not when it is convenient.</h1>
					<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0000d-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000d">One single-origin coffee a month, chosen because it just came off the drying beds somewhere in the world. Roasted the day after we ship, with the price we paid the farmer printed on the bag.</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000e e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e0000e-s " data-id="e0000e" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000e">
    			<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0000f-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000f"><a href="#start" target="_self" class="e-paragraph-link-base">
		Start next month
	</a></p>
					<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0000g-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000g"><a href="#calendar" target="_self" class="e-paragraph-link-base">
		See the coffee year
	</a></p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000h e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e0000h-s " data-id="e0000h" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000h">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000i e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e0000i-s " data-id="e0000i" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000i">
    
</div>
			<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0000j-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000j">In the box now: August, Gitwe washed Red Bourbon, Rwanda. Ships 22 August.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000k e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e0000k-s " data-id="e0000k" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000k">
    			<img fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" class="e-image-base e-1ol2zp5-e0000l-s" data-interaction-id="e0000l" id="251" src="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-twelve-harvests-cherries.jpg" width="512" height="512" srcset="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-twelve-harvests-cherries.jpg 512w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-twelve-harvests-cherries-300x300.jpg 300w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-twelve-harvests-cherries-150x150.jpg 150w" alt="Ripe coffee cherries on the branch"/>					<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0000m-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000m">Nyamasheke, Rwanda — the last selective pass, late June.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000n e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e0000n-s " data-id="e0000n" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000n" id="calendar">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000o e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e0000o-s " data-id="e0000o" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000o">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000p e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-1ol2zp5-e0000p-s " data-id="e0000p" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0000p">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000q e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e0000q-s " data-id="e0000q" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000q">
    			<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0000r-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000r">Section one</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e0000s" class="e-1ol2zp5-e0000s-s e-heading-base">The coffee year, January to December.</h2>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000t e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e0000t-s " data-id="e0000t" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000t">
    			<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0000u-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000u">Ethiopia and Rwanda in summer, Colombia in the autumn, Brazil after that, and Indonesia in the strange middle of the year when nothing else is fresh.</p>
					<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0000v-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000v">The spine below is the year. We do not repeat an origin twice in twelve months, and we do not buy anything that has been sitting.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000w e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e0000w-s " data-id="e0000w" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000w">
