		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003n e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e0003n-s " data-id="e0003n" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003n">
    			<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0003o-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003o">Colombia · Nariño</p>
					<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0003p-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003p">Washed Caturra grown at 2,050 metres. Lime leaf, caramel, bright and clean.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003q e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e0003q-s " data-id="e0003q" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003q">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003r e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e0003r-s " data-id="e0003r" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003r">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003s e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e0003s-s " data-id="e0003s" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003s">
    
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003t e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e0003t-s " data-id="e0003t" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003t">
    
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003u e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-1ol2zp5-e0003u-s " data-id="e0003u" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0003u">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0003v" class="e-1ol2zp5-e0003v-s e-heading-base">December</h3>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003w e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e0003w-s " data-id="e0003w" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003w">
    			<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0003x-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003x">Brazil · Cerrado Mineiro</p>
					<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0003y-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003y">Pulped natural Yellow Catuaí, straight after the Brazilian harvest. Hazelnut, milk chocolate, low acidity.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003z e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e0003z-s " data-id="e0003z" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003z">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00040 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e00040-s " data-id="e00040" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00040">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00041 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e00041-s " data-id="e00041" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00041">
    
</div>

</div>
			<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e00042-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00042">Then it starts again in Guatemala, with a crop nobody has tasted yet.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00043 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e00043-s " data-id="e00043" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00043">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00044 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e00044-s " data-id="e00044" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00044">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00045 e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-1ol2zp5-e00045-s " data-id="e00045" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e00045">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00046 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e00046-s " data-id="e00046" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00046">
    			<img decoding="async" class="e-image-base e-1ol2zp5-e00047-s" data-interaction-id="e00047" id="252" src="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-twelve-harvests-drying_beds.jpg" width="1024" height="576" srcset="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-twelve-harvests-drying_beds.jpg 1024w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-twelve-harvests-drying_beds-300x169.jpg 300w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-twelve-harvests-drying_beds-768x432.jpg 768w" alt="Parchment coffee drying on raised beds"/>					<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e00048-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00048">Raised beds at Gitwe. Eighteen days, turned by hand every hour of daylight.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00049 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e00049-s " data-id="e00049" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00049">
    			<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0004a-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004a">Section two · in the box now</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e0004b" class="e-1ol2zp5-e0004b-s e-heading-base">August: Gitwe washed Red Bourbon, Nyamasheke, Rwanda.</h2>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004c e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e0004c-s " data-id="e0004c" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004c">
    			<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0004d-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004d">Blackcurrant</p>
					<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0004e-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004e">Black tea</p>
					<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0004f-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004f">Stewed plum</p>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0004g-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004g">Blackcurrant, black tea, and a finish like a stewed plum. Ships 22 August, which is nineteen days after the last cherry came off the bed.</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004h e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-1ol2zp5-e0004h-s " data-id="e0004h" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0004h">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004i e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e0004i-s " data-id="e0004i" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004i">
    			<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0004j-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004j">Producer</p>
					<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0004k-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004k">Gitwe washing station, 219 smallholders</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004l e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e0004l-s " data-id="e0004l" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004l">
    			<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0004m-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004m">Altitude</p>
					<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0004n-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004n">1,780 – 1,940 m</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004o e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e0004o-s " data-id="e0004o" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004o">
    			<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0004p-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004p">Process</p>
					<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0004q-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004q">Fully washed, 18 days on raised beds</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004r e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e0004r-s " data-id="e0004r" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004r">
    			<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0004s-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004s">Ships</p>
					<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0004t-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004t">22 August, roasted the day before</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004u e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e0004u-s " data-id="e0004u" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004u">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004v e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e0004v-s " data-id="e0004v" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004v">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004w e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e0004w-s " data-id="e0004w" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004w">
    			<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0004x-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004x">Section three</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e0004y" class="e-1ol2zp5-e0004y-s e-heading-base">What we pay, and what everyone pays.</h2>
					<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0004z-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004z">We paid 5.40 a kilo at the farmgate. The Fairtrade floor is 1.80. The New York C price that week was 1.62.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00050 e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-1ol2zp5-e00050-s " data-id="e00050" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e00050">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00051 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e00051-s " data-id="e00051" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00051">
    			<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e00052-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00052">What we paid</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00053 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e00053-s " data-id="e00053" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00053">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e00054" class="e-1ol2zp5-e00054-s e-heading-base">5.40</h3>
					<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e00055-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00055">/ kilo</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00056 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e00056-s " data-id="e00056" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00056">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00057 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e00057-s " data-id="e00057" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00057">
    
</div>

</div>
			<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e00058-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00058">Per kilo, at the farmgate, to the Gitwe washing station.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00059 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e00059-s " data-id="e00059" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00059">
    			<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0005a-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005a">Fairtrade floor</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005b e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e0005b-s " data-id="e0005b" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005b">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0005c" class="e-1ol2zp5-e0005c-s e-heading-base">1.80</h3>
					<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0005d-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005d">/ kilo</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005e e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e0005e-s " data-id="e0005e" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005e">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005f e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e0005f-s " data-id="e0005f" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005f">
    
</div>

</div>
			<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0005g-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005g">The minimum price a certified buyer may pay.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005h e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e0005h-s " data-id="e0005h" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005h">
    			<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0005i-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005i">New York C</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005j e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e0005j-s " data-id="e0005j" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005j">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0005k" class="e-1ol2zp5-e0005k-s e-heading-base">1.62</h3>
					<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0005l-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005l">/ kilo</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005m e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e0005m-s " data-id="e0005m" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005m">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005n e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e0005n-s " data-id="e0005n" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005n">
    
</div>

</div>
			<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0005o-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005o">The commodity benchmark the week we bought.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005p e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e0005p-s " data-id="e0005p" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005p">
    			<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0005q-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005q">The number is printed on the bag next to the roast date. It is the price paid to the washing station for parchment, converted to green, before shipping and duty. Nobody makes you do this, which is exactly why we print it.</p>
					<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0005r-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005r">Three times the commodity price, on a lot that would clear at half of it.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005s e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e0005s-s " data-id="e0005s" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005s">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005t e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e0005t-s " data-id="e0005t" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005t">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005u e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-1ol2zp5-e0005u-s " data-id="e0005u" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0005u">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005v e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e0005v-s " data-id="e0005v" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005v">
    			<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0005w-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005w">Section four</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e0005x" class="e-1ol2zp5-e0005x-s e-heading-base">One roast profile, and a five-day head start.</h2>
					<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0005y-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005y">Roasted Tuesday, shipped Wednesday, on your table Thursday or Friday. Rest it four days before you touch it, then it is good for a month.</p>
					<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0005z-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005z">Filter roast only, dropped light enough to keep the acidity and long enough that nothing tastes green. We do not run a second, darker version for people with espresso machines.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00060 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e00060-s " data-id="e00060" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00060">
    			<img decoding="async" class="e-image-base e-1ol2zp5-e00061-s" data-interaction-id="e00061" id="250" src="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-twelve-harvests-brew_still.jpg" width="1024" height="768" srcset="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-twelve-harvests-brew_still.jpg 1024w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-twelve-harvests-brew_still-300x225.jpg 300w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-twelve-harvests-brew_still-768x576.jpg 768w" alt="A filter brew resting on a wooden counter"/>					<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e00062-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00062">Day five. 18g in, 300g out, four pours.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00063 e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-1ol2zp5-e00063-s " data-id="e00063" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e00063">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00064 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e00064-s " data-id="e00064" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00064">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00065 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e00065-s " data-id="e00065" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00065">
    
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00066 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e00066-s " data-id="e00066" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00066">
    
</div>
			<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e00067-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00067">Tuesday</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e00068" class="e-1ol2zp5-e00068-s e-heading-base">Roasted</h3>
					<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e00069-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00069">One profile, one drum, the whole month’s allocation in a morning.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006a e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e0006a-s " data-id="e0006a" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006a">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006b e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e0006b-s " data-id="e0006b" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006b">
    
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006c e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e0006c-s " data-id="e0006c" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006c">
    
</div>
			<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0006d-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006d">Wednesday</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e0006e" class="e-1ol2zp5-e0006e-s e-heading-base">Shipped</h3>
					<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0006f-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006f">Bagged with a valve and out the door before the beans are cool.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006g e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e0006g-s " data-id="e0006g" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006g">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006h e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e0006h-s " data-id="e0006h" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006h">
    
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006i e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e0006i-s " data-id="e0006i" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006i">
    
</div>
			<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0006j-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006j">Thursday</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e0006k" class="e-1ol2zp5-e0006k-s e-heading-base">On your table</h3>
					<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0006l-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006l">Friday at the latest. The date on the bag is the roast date, not a best-before.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006m e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e0006m-s " data-id="e0006m" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006m">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006n e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e0006n-s " data-id="e0006n" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006n">
    
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006o e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e0006o-s " data-id="e0006o" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006o">
    
</div>
			<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0006p-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006p">+4 days</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e0006q" class="e-1ol2zp5-e0006q-s e-heading-base">Rest it</h3>
					<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0006r-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006r">Leave it alone. Degassing coffee brews thin and tastes of nothing much.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006s e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e0006s-s " data-id="e0006s" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006s">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006t e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e0006t-s " data-id="e0006t" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006t">
    
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006u e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e0006u-s " data-id="e0006u" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006u">
    
</div>
			<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0006v-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006v">+1 month</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e0006w" class="e-1ol2zp5-e0006w-s e-heading-base">Drink it</h3>
					<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0006x-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006x">Past that it is still fine, just quieter. Nothing here sits in a warehouse.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006y e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e0006y-s " data-id="e0006y" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006y">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006z e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e0006z-s " data-id="e0006z" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006z">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00070 e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-1ol2zp5-e00070-s " data-id="e00070" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e00070">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00071 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e00071-s " data-id="e00071" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00071">
    			<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e00072-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00072">Section five</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e00073" class="e-1ol2zp5-e00073-s e-heading-base">Three ways in, one starting recipe.</h2>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00074 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e00074-s " data-id="e00074" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00074">
    			<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e00075-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00075">Filter recipe to start: 18g in, 300g out, 94 degrees, four pours, three and a half minutes total. Adjust the grind, not the ratio.</p>
					<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e00076-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00076">Every bag ships with the month’s numbers on the back, because a Rwandan washed lot and a wet-hulled Sumatra do not want the same grind.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00077 e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-1ol2zp5-e00077-s " data-id="e00077" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e00077">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00078 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e00078-s " data-id="e00078" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00078">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e00079" class="e-1ol2zp5-e00079-s e-heading-base">V60</h3>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007a e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e0007a-s " data-id="e0007a" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0007a">
    
</div>
			<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0007b-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007b">18g in, 300g out</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007c e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e0007c-s " data-id="e0007c" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0007c">
    			<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0007d-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007d">Medium-fine, a little finer than table salt</p>
					<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0007e-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007e">3:30 total, four pours</p>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0007f-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007f">Bloom 50g for 40 seconds, then pour to 300 in even stages.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007g e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e0007g-s " data-id="e0007g" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0007g">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0007h" class="e-1ol2zp5-e0007h-s e-heading-base">Kalita Wave</h3>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007i e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e0007i-s " data-id="e0007i" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0007i">
    
</div>
			<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0007j-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007j">20g in, 320g out</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007k e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e0007k-s " data-id="e0007k" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0007k">
    			<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0007l-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007l">Medium, the flat bed is forgiving</p>
					<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0007m-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007m">3:15 total, five pours</p>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0007n-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007n">Keep the bed flat and the water level low. It wants patience, not technique.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007o e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e0007o-s " data-id="e0007o" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0007o">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0007p" class="e-1ol2zp5-e0007p-s e-heading-base">Chemex</h3>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007q e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e0007q-s " data-id="e0007q" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0007q">
    
</div>
			<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0007r-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007r">30g in, 500g out</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007s e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e0007s-s " data-id="e0007s" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0007s">
    			<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0007t-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007t">Medium-coarse, the thick filter is slow</p>
					<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0007u-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007u">4:30 total, three pours</p>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0007v-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007v">Rinse the filter properly. Anything less and you will taste the paper.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007w e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e0007w-s " data-id="e0007w" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0007w">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007x e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e0007x-s " data-id="e0007x" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0007x">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007y e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e0007y-s " data-id="e0007y" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0007y">
    			<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0007z-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007z">Section six</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e00080" class="e-1ol2zp5-e00080-s e-heading-base">Two sizes, and a pause button that actually pauses.</h2>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00081 e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-1ol2zp5-e00081-s " data-id="e00081" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e00081">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00082 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e00082-s " data-id="e00082" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00082">
    			<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e00083-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00083">most people start here</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00084 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e00084-s " data-id="e00084" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00084">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e00085" class="e-1ol2zp5-e00085-s e-heading-base">250g</h3>
					<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e00086-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00086">21</p>
					<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e00087-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00087">a month</p>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e00088-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00088">One bag a month. About fifteen brews for a single filter drinker, which is most people who own a grinder.</p>
					<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e00089-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00089"><a href="#start" target="_self" class="e-paragraph-link-base">
		Start next month
	</a></p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0008a e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e0008a-s " data-id="e0008a" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0008a">
    			<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0008b-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0008b">for two, or for one who drinks a lot</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0008c e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e0008c-s " data-id="e0008c" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0008c">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0008d" class="e-1ol2zp5-e0008d-s e-heading-base">500g</h3>
					<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0008e-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0008e">36</p>
					<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0008f-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0008f">a month</p>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0008g-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0008g">Same coffee, twice the bag, one delivery. Cheaper per cup and it still arrives four days off the roaster.</p>
					<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0008h-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0008h"><a href="#start" target="_self" class="e-paragraph-link-base">
		Start next month
	</a></p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0008i e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e0008i-s " data-id="e0008i" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0008i">
    			<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0008j-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0008j">Pausing</p>
					<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0008k-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0008k">250g a month for 21. 500g for 36. Pause any time from the email, no login, no retention offer, no dark pattern.</p>
					<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0008l-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0008l">There is a pause link at the bottom of every dispatch note. One click holds the next shipment, two holds it until you say otherwise.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0008m e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e0008m-s " data-id="e0008m" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0008m">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0008n e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e0008n-s " data-id="e0008n" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0008n">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0008o e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-1ol2zp5-e0008o-s " data-id="e0008o" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0008o">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0008p e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e0008p-s " data-id="e0008p" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0008p">
    			<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0008q-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0008q">Section seven</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e0008r" class="e-1ol2zp5-e0008r-s e-heading-base">Where the last twenty-four coffees came from.</h2>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0008s e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e0008s-s " data-id="e0008s" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0008s">
    			<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0008t-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0008t">Two years of boxes, eight countries, twenty-four lots. No origin has appeared twice in the same twelve months, and every farmgate price is still on the archive page.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0008u e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-1ol2zp5-e0008u-s " data-id="e0008u" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0008u">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0008v e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e0008v-s " data-id="e0008v" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0008v">
    			<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0008w-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0008w">5 bags</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e0008x" class="e-1ol2zp5-e0008x-s e-heading-base">Ethiopia</h3>
					<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0008y-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0008y">Guji, Yirgacheffe, and one lot from Uraga.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0008z e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e0008z-s " data-id="e0008z" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0008z">
    			<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e00090-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00090">4 bags</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e00091" class="e-1ol2zp5-e00091-s e-heading-base">Colombia</h3>
					<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e00092-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00092">Huila and Nariño, two autumns running.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00093 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e00093-s " data-id="e00093" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00093">
    			<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e00094-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00094">3 bags</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e00095" class="e-1ol2zp5-e00095-s e-heading-base">Rwanda</h3>
					<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e00096-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00096">Nyamasheke and Rulindo, all washed.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00097 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e00097-s " data-id="e00097" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00097">
    			<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e00098-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00098">3 bags</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e00099" class="e-1ol2zp5-e00099-s e-heading-base">Brazil</h3>
					<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0009a-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0009a">Cerrado Mineiro, pulped natural, every December.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0009b e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e0009b-s " data-id="e0009b" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0009b">
    			<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0009c-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0009c">3 bags</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e0009d" class="e-1ol2zp5-e0009d-s e-heading-base">Indonesia</h3>
					<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0009e-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0009e">Aceh Gayo and Toraja, wet-hulled.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0009f e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e0009f-s " data-id="e0009f" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0009f">
    			<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0009g-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0009g">2 bags</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e0009h" class="e-1ol2zp5-e0009h-s e-heading-base">Guatemala</h3>
					<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0009i-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0009i">Huehuetenango, both washed Caturra.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0009j e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e0009j-s " data-id="e0009j" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0009j">
    			<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0009k-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0009k">2 bags</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e0009l" class="e-1ol2zp5-e0009l-s e-heading-base">Costa Rica</h3>
					<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0009m-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0009m">Tarrazú honeys from the same mill.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0009n e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e0009n-s " data-id="e0009n" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0009n">
    			<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0009o-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0009o">2 bags</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e0009p" class="e-1ol2zp5-e0009p-s e-heading-base">El Salvador</h3>
					<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0009q-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0009q">Santa Ana naturals, one Pacamara, one Bourbon.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0009r e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e0009r-s " data-id="e0009r" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0009r" id="start">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0009s e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e0009s-s " data-id="e0009s" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0009s">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0009t e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1ol2zp5-e0009t-s " data-id="e0009t" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0009t">
