			<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0009v-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0009v">Section eight</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e0009w" class="e-1ol2zp5-e0009w-s e-heading-base">Start with next month’s harvest.</h2>
					<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0009x-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0009x">Order before the 18th and the September lot is yours: Ethiopian natural heirloom, forty days on raised beds, roasted the day after we ship.</p>
					<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0009y-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0009y"><a href="#calendar" target="_self" class="e-paragraph-link-base">
		Start next month
	</a></p>
					<p class="e-1ol2zp5-e0009z-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0009z">21 a month for 250g · pause from any email · farmgate price on every bag</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>
